     {"text": "GIVE IT FIFTEEN MINUTES IN THE SAUCE, NOT EIGHT. ⚠️ The pork needs the time and the extra seven minutes will not hurt the tofu. ✅ Lid on, barest simmer, and still no stirring — turn each slab once at the halfway point with a spoon and a spatula, using both hands."}
