   "trivia": "The chay kitchens make the stuffed version constantly, and the filling has to be built rather than simply swapped. ⚖️ Pork brought fat and moisture to the pocket; mushrooms bring water and nothing to hold it, so they have to be cooked down hard first and then bound with something that will absorb what is left. ✅ A little softened rice vermicelli chopped fine does that job, and it is what stops the pocket weeping into the sauce.",
