 "storage": "⛔ Drink it now. This does not hold: the fat warms and the drink separates within about twenty minutes, and a night in the fridge turns it grey and grainy. ✅ Frozen avocado cubes keep 3 months in a sealed bag and are the whole answer to this problem — freeze a batch whenever avocados are cheap and a glass is then ninety seconds away. Condensed milk keeps a month opened, in a jar rather than the tin.",
 "chefNotes": "⚖️ Freeze the avocado and leave the ice tray alone. Everything good about this glass follows from that one swap.\n\n✅ Short bursts on the blender. A machine left running warms the fat, and warm fat is thin fat.\n\n⚠️ Do not reach for water when it stalls. Stop, stir, restart — water dilutes the only thing giving this drink a body.\n\n⛔ Never use evaporated milk in place of condensed. They sound alike, one of them is unsweetened, and the result is thin and faintly savoury.",
